1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,094
In this town, everybody has a pet.

2
00:00:01,994 --> 00:00:04,409
HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS!

3
00:00:04,409 --> 00:00:05,906
Grandma's cat can do a backflip.

4
00:00:05,836 --> 00:00:07,812
The mailman's dog can jump through a hoop.

5
00:00:07,912 --> 00:00:10,619
Except me. Mom said pets are too much work.

6
00:00:10,719 --> 00:00:13,358
So I got a rock. His name is Gary.

7
00:00:13,458 --> 00:00:17,079
Gary doesn't bark. Gary doesn't eat. Gary doesn't do anything.

8
00:00:17,179 --> 00:00:20,058
Then came the Pet Show. First prize: the golden bone.

9
00:00:20,058 --> 00:00:23,073
The cat did a triple backflip. The dog jumped through three hoops.

10
00:00:23,023 --> 00:00:26,760
Then it was Gary's turn. Gary just sat there. For one whole minute.

11
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:28,923
Everybody laughed. Even the dog laughed.

12
00:00:29,023 --> 00:00:31,269
So I trained Gary. Every single night.

13
00:00:31,219 --> 00:00:36,106
Sit, Gary. He sat. Stay, Gary. He stayed. Roll over, Gary. We're still working on that.

14
00:00:36,156 --> 00:00:38,831
At the final, the judge said: show me your best trick.

15
00:00:38,781 --> 00:00:41,065
I took the biggest breath of my life.

16
00:00:41,065 --> 00:00:41,583
HUSS!

17
00:00:41,633 --> 00:00:45,545
Every pet in the stadium flew into the mud. Gary didn't move one inch.

18
00:00:45,595 --> 00:00:47,998
Best behaved pet in town. Golden bone.

19
00:00:48,098 --> 00:00:50,172
Now everybody in this town has a rock.

20
00:00:50,072 --> 00:00:52,844
HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS!

